{"title":"長時間輕鬆跑的心率飄移","description":"長時間平路輕鬆跑的心率飄移：後段心率比前段多飄了幾 %。\n怎麼看：每根長條 = 一次跑步；綠 < 5% 穩定、橘 5–10% 有點飄、紅 > 10% 飄很多；虛線 = 5%。滑過長條看當天溫度。\n看什麼：基礎期綠色越來越多、長條越來越矮；紅色多 = 輕鬆跑太快，或太熱、沒補給。看最近幾根的走向，不看單根。\n方法：暖身後還有 ≥ 30 分鐘、沒有爬坡和停頓的穩定路跑，同總覽「心率飄移」。5% 是 Uphill Athlete 有氧閾值測試的標準，10% 是 90 分鐘測試的標準（台灣教練）。","kind":"athlete","axes":[{"id":"PERCENT","used":true,"unit":{"id":"PERCENT","label":"%","kind":"percent","dec":[[10,0],[0,1]],"scale":100.0}}],"parity":false,"fixes":[],"begin":"2026-09-27","end":"2026-10-03","workout":null,"series":[{"id":null,"name":"穩定（< 5%）","type":"bar","color":"#16a34a","y_axis":"PERCENT","x_axis":"DATE","line_style":"solid","line_width":"medium","expression":"if(sport=\"run\" and !hastag(\"runningtrail\") and drift(\"pace\", \"all\") < 0.05, drift(\"pace\", \"all\"))","data":{"kind":"points","x":"datetime","points":[["2026-09-30T05:43:00",0.025495877117732064],["2026-10-01T06:21:00",0.03280141178360866]]},"unit":{"id":"PERCENT","label":"%","kind":"percent","dec":[[10,0],[0,1]],"scale":100.0},"x_unit":{"id":"DATE","label":"日期","kind":"date","dec":[[0,0]]},"ms":323,"tips":["2026-09-30・跑 59 分・🌡 25 °C（25–28 °C）\n天熱，飄移本來就會偏高","2026-10-01・跑 2 小時 29 分・🌡 25 °C（25–28 °C）\n天熱，飄移本來就會偏高"]},{"id":null,"name":"有點飄（5–10%）","type":"bar","color":"#f59e0b","y_axis":"PERCENT","x_axis":"DATE","line_style":"solid","line_width":"medium","expression":"if(sport=\"run\" and !hastag(\"runningtrail\") and drift(\"pace\", \"all\") >= 0.05 and drift(\"pace\", \"all\") < 0.10, drift(\"pace\", \"all\"))","data":{"kind":"points","x":"datetime","points":[["2026-10-02T05:40:00",0.06589394908878164]]},"unit":{"id":"PERCENT","label":"%","kind":"percent","dec":[[10,0],[0,1]],"scale":100.0},"x_unit":{"id":"DATE","label":"日期","kind":"date","dec":[[0,0]]},"ms":435,"tips":["2026-10-02・跑 42 分・🌡 25 °C（< 25 °C）\n暖身後不到 40 分鐘，只當參考"],"labels":["最新 6.6%"]},{"id":null,"name":"飄很多（> 10%）","type":"bar","color":"#dc2626","y_axis":"PERCENT","x_axis":"DATE","line_style":"solid","line_width":"medium","expression